 <h3><u>Mei panjo pe</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4>Mei panjo pe</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4>Zindan ki tarikiyoo mei, apne sine se lagaaye huwe shabbir ka sar. Sakina kehti thi, baba, baba, suno mera safar</font></p>
  <font face=Comic Sans MS size=4> <p>Are (sab ke the shaane bandhe, mera bandha tha ghala) x2 </p> <p>(Mei panjo pe chalti rahi baba) x3</p> 
   <ol>
    <li>Aap se kaise kahu, kaise kata wo safar, aal-e-payambar chali rote huwe nange sar (aap chale neze par, kanto pe bhayi chala) x2 </li>
    <p>(Mei panjo pe chalti rahi baba) x3</p>
    <li>Mere phuphi raah me ashk bahati rahi, Zulm rulaate rahe dhoop jalaati rahi (zakhm mere pawo ka dhoop se jalta raha) x2 </li>
    <p>(Mei panjo pe chalti rahi baba) x3</p>
    <li>Mazi ke kuch waakayey yaad jo aye muje, sine pe kaise muje aap sulaate rahe (Yaado mei yu kho gayi bhul gayi har jafaa) x2 </li>
    <p>(Mei panjo pe chalti rahi baba) x3</p>
    <li>Sabr ka daman mere haath se chuta nahi, neze se kya aapne baba ye dekha nahi (kichti rahi reesima chalta raha kafla) x2</li>
    <p>(Mei panjo pe chalti rahi baba) x3</p>
    <li>Ankh barasne lage kalb huwa nawha ghar, aya nazar jab muje neze pe asghar ka sar (Roti rahi mei use wo muje rota raha) x2 </li>
    <p>(Mei panjo pe chalti rahi baba) x3</p>
    <li>Tumko kafan dediya reyt kei tufaan nei, Baalo se parda kiya meri phuphi jaan ne (Aur mere dard ka koi madaawa na tha) x2</li>
    <p>(Mei panjo pe chalti rahi baba) x3</p>
    <li>Raah me ammu ko jab dekha to maine kaha, kholdo meri rasan god mei leylo chacha (Dekhke rote rahe meri aseeri chacha) x2 </li>
    <p>(Mei panjo pe chalti rahi baba) x3</p>
    <li>Chen mayassar muje aa na saka aik pal, zakhmi gala hogaya aur mere pawu shal (Raat safar mei kati din bhi safar mei kataa) x2</li>
    <li>Baba madine ke wo din bhi muje yaad hai, sabz amari mei jab beyt ke jaati thi mei (Aaj zara dekhiye, kaise safar teykiya) x2</li>
    <p>(Mei panjo pe chalti rahi baba) x3</p>
    <li>Ek rasan mei bandhe chothe baro ke ghale, lasho pe rote huwe karbobala se chale (Haal mera dekh ke rone lagi karbala) x2</li>
   </ol> <p>(Mei panjo pe chalti rahi baba) x3</p></font>
